    "en": {
      "name": "Ghostrick Art",
      "effect": "Tribute up to 2 \"Ghostrick\" monsters from your hand and/or field, and if you do, Special Summon that many \"Ghostrick\" monsters from your Deck with different names from each other, each in face-up or face-down Defense Position, also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn, except DARK monsters. During your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY; change 1 face-down Defense Position \"Ghostrick\" monster you control to face-up Defense Position. You can only use each effect of \"Ghostrick Art\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
